    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2>NEETNectar's Abysmally Small Assortment is a collection of minimalistic games with a maximum of 3 inputs per game. All the games will be score based, and we may add new games as we think of them. The games currently available are:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Air Walk Ninja - An endless side scrolling platformer<br></li><li>Paddle Hero - A paddle style game where the ball is a weapon<br></li><li>Symbol Says - A casual memory based game<br></li><li>Clicker Boss - An idle type game with brutal conditions<br></li><li>Asteroids and Aliens - A simple shoot 'em up type game<br></li><li>Fist Bump - An endless side scrolling beat 'em  up</li></ul>",
